sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient
    participant MVC as PatientAppointmentController
    participant API as AppointmentsController
    participant Svc as AppointmentService
    participant Avail as ClinicalStaffAvailabilityService
    participant DB as SQL Server (38 Tables)

    Patient->>MVC: GET /Patient/Appointment/Services?category=Combo
    MVC->>API: GET /api/patient/appointments/combos
    API->>Svc: GetAvailableCombosAsync()
    Svc->>DB: SELECT ServiceCombos & ServiceComboItems WHERE IsActive=1
    DB-->>MVC: Combo Catalog (COMBO_CARE = 500,000 VND Demo Price)

    Patient->>MVC: Select Service/Combo, Date & Optional Dentist
    MVC->>API: GET /api/booking/slots
    API->>Avail: GetAvailableSlotsAsync(serviceId, date, dentistId)
    Avail->>DB: Query ClinicProfile, StaffWorkSchedules, StaffLeaveRequests, AppointmentServices
    DB-->>MVC: Valid shift slots (08:00-12:00, 13:00-17:00)

    Patient->>MVC: POST /Patient/Appointment/Book
    MVC->>API: POST /api/patient/appointments
    API->>Svc: CreatePatientAppointmentAsync(patientUserId, request)
    Svc->>DB: Check PatientProfiles.DateOfBirth (Pediatric <= 15 yrs rule)
    Svc->>DB: Check same-day shift quota (Max 2 appts/day in distinct shifts)
    Svc->>DB: INSERT Appointments (Status='PendingReceptionReview')
    Svc->>DB: INSERT AppointmentServices (Status='PendingReceptionReview')
    Svc->>DB: INSERT Notifications & AuditLogs
    DB-->>MVC: AppointmentCreated (AppointmentCode)
    MVC-->>Patient: Redirect to /Patient/Appointment/Success